# ================= 通用 =================
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
~$*

# ================= Xilinx Vivado 2018.3 =================
# 构建 / 缓存目录：由 .xpr + .srcs 重新生成，体积大且频繁变动
**/*.cache/
**/*.runs/
**/*.sim/
**/*.hw/
**/*.gen/
**/*.ip_user_files/
**/*.ioplanning/
**/.Xil/
# 运行日志与临时状态
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.vdi
*.wdb
*.wcfg
*.pb
*.rpx
*.backup.jou
*.backup.vdi
# 综合 / 实现输出（可重新生成）
*.bit
*.bin
*.mcs
*.prm
*.ltx
*.dcp
# 编辑器备份
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*
*.backup.*

# ================= Xilinx SDK / Vitis (Eclipse) =================
# 工作区元数据与编译产物，保留 *.hdf / hw_platform / src / bsp 源码
**/*.sdk/.metadata/
**/*.sdk/RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
**/*.sdk/webtalk/
**/*.sdk/**/Debug/
**/*.sdk/**/Release/
# BSP 由 .hdf 重新生成，只保留驱动配置 system.mss
**/*_bsp/*
!**/*_bsp/system.mss
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.map
*.su

# Vivado IP 生成的仿真行为模型（由 .xci 重新生成，单个 14 MB）
**/ip/**/hdl/*vhsyn_rfs*

# ================= LaTeX =================
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.xdv
tmp-pdfcrop-*
*.bbl
*.blg
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
